OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRemaining cloudy in the north
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain, becoming
OL,7,Fheavier and more persistent across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland and western Scotland
OL,9,Fduring the afternoon. Further south,
OL,10,Fhazy sunshine will develop, making it
OL,11,Ffeel very warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain across the
OL,14,Fnorth will spread into northern
OL,15,FEngland and North Wales by dawn.
OL,16,FFurther south, it will remain dry with
OL,17,Fclear spells. A slight cooler night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
