OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA wet start across many
OL,6,Fnorthern and central areas of the
OL,7,Fcountry, with rain moving erratically
OL,8,Fsouthwards during the day. Turning
OL,9,Fbrighter but fresher from the north.
